{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this DLC, you can:</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find new resource!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As well as gold, you can install extensions to your wash plant and hunt for gems! You can sell the gems to earn money early on, or exchange them for skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/8f4f2220bb37ba67cc0ce07ac0f5bc9f.poster.avif?t=1759303404\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/8f4f2220bb37ba67cc0ce07ac0f5bc9f.webm?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/8f4f2220bb37ba67cc0ce07ac0f5bc9f.mp4?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover new digging spots!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new claim is full of places to explore. You will experience landslides, marshlands and open-pit mines, and you might even stumble upon old, abandoned cave mines! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/52a7c24951f2811f4329c1e61333c7c2.poster.avif?t=1759303404\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/52a7c24951f2811f4329c1e61333c7c2.webm?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/52a7c24951f2811f4329c1e61333c7c2.mp4?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face new challenges!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each parcel will present different challenges, such as fallen rocks and logs that need to be removed, flooded land, machines sinking in the water, and overwhelming darkness in the mines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/130b3e5506b2494d8129eef20c969ba9.poster.avif?t=1759303404\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/130b3e5506b2494d8129eef20c969ba9.webm?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/130b3e5506b2494d8129eef20c969ba9.mp4?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Operate the new backhoe loader</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a versatile backhoe loader to dig, transport, and shape terrain with precision. Perfect for loading material and speeding up your mining operations early on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/410dda388a2bd30ab7ddceb346478978.poster.avif?t=1759303404\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/410dda388a2bd30ab7ddceb346478978.webm?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/410dda388a2bd30ab7ddceb346478978.mp4?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alternative game start</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to its progressive development, this map offers many hours of gameplay, providing a great new starting point all the way through to mid-game. It will appeal to both new players and veteran miners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/985a6337aecefec64b5d8152f89c557d.poster.avif?t=1759303404\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/985a6337aecefec64b5d8152f89c557d.webm?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/985a6337aecefec64b5d8152f89c557d.mp4?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unravel hidden secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many of the places and buildings have their own stories to tell. Some new mechanics will help you with resource control and speed up the early grind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/a1c57ac1142c86c597942038cae901d2.poster.avif?t=1759303404\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/a1c57ac1142c86c597942038cae901d2.webm?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/a1c57ac1142c86c597942038cae901d2.mp4?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC is your golden opportunity to redefine your mining experience! Don\u2019t miss the chance to take your gold mining to a whole new level with the fourth DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056800?t=1759303404","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/b0f540b9ab2e96b6637bc9edef7b06aea8e8ba59/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759303404","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/265c08a59b90b7c6ef11151ab7bd38928b63f437/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759303404","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/265c08a59b90b7c6ef11151ab7bd38928b63f437/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759303404","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this DLC, you can:</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find new resource!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As well as gold, you can install extensions to your wash plant and hunt for gems! You can sell the gems to earn money early on, or exchange them for skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/8f4f2220bb37ba67cc0ce07ac0f5bc9f.poster.avif?t=1759303404\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/8f4f2220bb37ba67cc0ce07ac0f5bc9f.webm?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/8f4f2220bb37ba67cc0ce07ac0f5bc9f.mp4?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover new digging spots!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new claim is full of places to explore. You will experience landslides, marshlands and open-pit mines, and you might even stumble upon old, abandoned cave mines! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/52a7c24951f2811f4329c1e61333c7c2.poster.avif?t=1759303404\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/52a7c24951f2811f4329c1e61333c7c2.webm?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/52a7c24951f2811f4329c1e61333c7c2.mp4?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face new challenges!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each parcel will present different challenges, such as fallen rocks and logs that need to be removed, flooded land, machines sinking in the water, and overwhelming darkness in the mines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/130b3e5506b2494d8129eef20c969ba9.poster.avif?t=1759303404\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/130b3e5506b2494d8129eef20c969ba9.webm?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/130b3e5506b2494d8129eef20c969ba9.mp4?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Operate the new backhoe loader</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a versatile backhoe loader to dig, transport, and shape terrain with precision. Perfect for loading material and speeding up your mining operations early on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/410dda388a2bd30ab7ddceb346478978.poster.avif?t=1759303404\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/410dda388a2bd30ab7ddceb346478978.webm?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/410dda388a2bd30ab7ddceb346478978.mp4?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alternative game start</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to its progressive development, this map offers many hours of gameplay, providing a great new starting point all the way through to mid-game. It will appeal to both new players and veteran miners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/985a6337aecefec64b5d8152f89c557d.poster.avif?t=1759303404\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/985a6337aecefec64b5d8152f89c557d.webm?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/985a6337aecefec64b5d8152f89c557d.mp4?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unravel hidden secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many of the places and buildings have their own stories to tell. Some new mechanics will help you with resource control and speed up the early grind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/a1c57ac1142c86c597942038cae901d2.poster.avif?t=1759303404\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/a1c57ac1142c86c597942038cae901d2.webm?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/extras/a1c57ac1142c86c597942038cae901d2.mp4?t=1759303404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC is your golden opportunity to redefine your mining experience! Don\u2019t miss the chance to take your gold mining to a whole new level with the fourth DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Code Horizon"],"fullgame":{"appid":"451340","name":"Gold Mining Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056800/df84bf4c5263ea4ed0caee4899bcb97c1c6394dc/header.jpg?t=1759303404","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Code Horizon, Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4056800/1201052098/eff1cd1d3a11d888db96a45b1e50f217516c2986/1759225437/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759235240","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4056800/1201052098/eff1cd1d3a11d888db96a45b1e50f21751